; Search-selectable tiled matmul. The last child is the tile-CONFIG index; the
; match rule below mints one enode per config, so Luminal's genome search picks
; the config by profiling (distinct enodes = distinct producers of the matmul).
(constructor LayoutTensorOpMatmulTiledGeneric (LayoutTensor LayoutTensor Layout i64) LayoutTensorOp)
